11:27:24","source":"Livesquawk"},{"id":"260410191473525","title":"Maharashtra Scooters, once a scooter manufacturer, now functions as a CIC, holding stakes in Bajaj Group firms like Bajaj Auto, Bajaj Finance, and Bajaj Finserv.\nIt trades at a 55% holding discount, offers high margins, and provides indirect exposure to Bajaj's ecosystem but faces valuation, transparency, and tax challenges.","summary":"Maharashtra Scooters, once a scooter manufacturer, now functions as a CIC, holding stakes in Bajaj Group firms like Bajaj Auto, Bajaj Finance, and Bajaj Finserv.\nIt trades at a 55% holding discount, offers high margins, and provides indirect exposure to Bajaj's ecosystem but faces valuation, transparency, and tax challenges.","url":"https://www.financialexpress.com/market/stock-insights/the-secret-bajaj-why-this-rs-33766-crore-proxy-is-a-hidden-gem/4201782/","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-04-09T05:30:00","source":"Financial Express"},{"id":"824875784575773696","title":"Maharashtra Scooters Ltd acquired 0.0039% stake in Bajaj Finance Ltd.\nThe acquisition, worth Rs. 21.6 Cr, was through secondary market on 25 March 2026.","summary":"Maharashtra Scooters Ltd acquired 0.0039% stake in Bajaj Finance Ltd.\nThe acquisition, worth Rs. 21.6 Cr, was through secondary market on 25 March 2026.","url":"https://sqst.in/shareMessage?msgId=824875784575773689","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-03-26T10:51:52","source":"ScoutQuest"},{"id":"436263","title":"Maharashtra Scooters' Q3 net profit rose to ₹41M from ₹33M YoY.\nQ3 revenue increased to ₹64M from ₹58M YoY for Maharashtra Scooters.","summary":"Maharashtra Scooters' Q3 net profit rose to ₹41M from ₹33M YoY.\nQ3 revenue increased to ₹64M from ₹58M YoY for Maharashtra Scooters.","url":"","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-01-12T15:15:16","source":"Livesquawk"},{"id":"425778","title":"Maharashtra Scooters' board will meet on 12 Jan 2026 to review unaudited financial results for Q3 and 9 months ending Dec 2025.\nTrading window for compa